    npx:hasNanopubType <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/Concept> ;
    rdfs:comment "Every source URL in this record was fetched when it was built and resolved, and each file's content at the pinned commit 4ebb56add61de66744fe8b957ecd7c0bcecc8083 is the content this record was built from (checked 2026-10-31T23:21:08.768Z; lean/Delphi/Genotype.lean at git blob 80ad0c7235). A reader can check that claim with git cat-file. The pinned commit is reachable by SHA from https://github.com/fractastical/delphisci (GitHub serves any commit in a fork network by SHA), but it is NOT an ancestor of that repository's main branch as fetched 2026-10-31T18:02:23.846Z: the work is on a branch and unmerged, so \"the citation resolves\" is not \"the change is merged\"." ;
    rdfs:comment "Hand-authored in Delphi ontology v2.0 terms (https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/) by the builder, not created from a template. The template that would otherwise apply as Provenance template is <https://w3id.org/np/RAaYeFYF-Cz2bM5S1wPQsnvs5X6BBxsphL03UkbVZ1lcA>. Its published copy carries no legacy probknow IRI (checked 2026-10-31); it was consulted but not instantiated, so no template is declared. A template-conformance checker will therefore report no template declared." ;
